          "text": "Recent psychotic episode"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Approximately 2 weeks before this review, acute agitation with auditory and visual hallucinations and paranoia after heavy stimulant use (reported as speed, possibly mixed with something else). Observed in ED without formal admission; symptoms settled over approximately 24–36 hours."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Current psychotic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies current auditory or visual hallucinations and paranoia; reports no longer seeing or hearing things and says thinking is clear. No delusions or ideas of reference observed."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
