        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mental status examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Calm and cooperative with good eye contact; normal speech; mood described as stressed but alright, with full and reactive affect; linear, goal-directed thought process; no suicidal or homicidal ideation; oriented with cognition grossly intact; insight and judgment intact."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
